From be0db2bd3c9fd7acba780078033ff2aec82ba479 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:12:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add contract-export and contract-compare for reconciling
 independent pipelines

A bundle carries the contract a pipeline scored against and its per-key
evidence. contract-export writes one from this engine and refuses to
finish unless the bundle reproduces the evaluator's total score;
contract-compare reports common and extra keys, weight, placement and
definition differences, value, unit, period and source conflicts on keys
both pipelines closed, and union coverage counted once per contract slot.

